  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. D dorian vs D natural minor:\n\n- A) Major sixth\n- B) Lowered third\n- C) No fourth\n- D) Extra sharps\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Mixolydian lowers the 7th vs major.\n\n**Answer:** True",
